### Liste anzeigen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/medications

### ✅ Verbrauchen: normaler Fall
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ENOX40/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2, "note": "Zi. 12, Fr. Müller" }

### ✅ Ohne note (note ist optional)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-NACL500/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### ✅ Zu lange note → wird gekürzt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-NACL500/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1, "note": "Zimmer 12, Frau Müller, nach der OP am Morgen" }

### ❌ Menge 0
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ENOX40/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 0 }

### ❌ Mehr als Bestand
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ENOX40/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 999 }

### ❌ Unbekanntes Material
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-GIBTSNICHT/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### ❌ Ohne quantity
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ENOX40/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "nur Notiz" }

### ✅ Nachbestellen → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ENOX40/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 14 }

### ❌ Nochmal nachbestellen → 409 (schon offen)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ENOX40/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 14 }

### ❌ Nachbestellen mit Menge 0 → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-ONDAN4/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 0 }

### ❌ Nachbestellen unbekanntes Material → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medications/MED-GIBTSNICHT/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 5 }
